hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1272","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Amra bint Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke Aisha Ummul Momineen ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un ke paas they aur unhon ne aik shakhs ki awaz suni jo Hafsa ke ghar mein ijazat mang raha tha. Aisha ne kaha ke maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah ye shakhs Aap ke ghar mein ijazat mang raha hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main use fulan samajhta hun, Hafsa ke doodh wale chacha. To Aisha ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah agar fulan zinda hote, un ke doodh wale chacha, to kya wo mere paas dakhil hote. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, doodh se wo haram hota hai jo wiladat se haram hota hai."
"1273","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Aisha Ummul Momineen se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mere doodh wale chacha mere paas ijazat mangne aae aur maine inkar kar diya ke unhein ijazat dun yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is ke bare mein puchhun, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aae aur maine Aap se is ke bare mein pucha to farmaya ke wo tumhare chacha hain, unhein ijazat do. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah mujhe sirf aurat ne doodh pilaya hai, mard ne mujhe doodh nahi pilaya. To farmaya ke wo tumhare chacha hain, wo tum par dakhil hon. Aisha ne kaha ke ye hijab hum par farz hone ke baad tha. Aur Aisha ne kaha ke doodh se wo haram hota hai jo wiladat se haram hota hai."
"1274","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Aisha Ummul Momineen se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Aflah Abul Quais ke bhai mere paas ijazat mangne aae jabke wo mere doodh wale chacha hain, hijab nazil hone ke baad. Unhon ne kaha ke maine inkar kar diya ke unhein apne paas ijazat dun, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aae to maine Aap ko jo maine kya tha us ki khabar di, to unhon ne mujhe hukm diya ke unhein apne paas ijazat dun."
"1275","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Saur bin Zaid Dili se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abbas se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke jo do saal mein ho chahe aik ghont ho wo haram karta hai."
"1276","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Amr bin Shuraid se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Abbas se aik shakhs ke bare mein pucha gaya jis ki do biwiyan thin, to aik ne ladke ko doodh pilaya aur dusri ne ladki ko doodh pilaya, to un se kaha gaya ke kya ladka ladki se nikah kare. To unhon ne kaha ke nahi, doodh aik hai."
"1277","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar kehte they ke doodh sirf us ke liye hai jis ne bachpan mein doodh piya, aur bade ke liye koi doodh nahi."
"1278","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar ne unhein khabar di ke Aisha Ummul Momineen ne unhein doodh peete hue un ki behan Umm Kulsoom bint Abi Bakr Siddiq ke paas bheja aur kaha ke use das ghont pilao taake wo mere paas dakhil ho. Salim ne kaha ke Umm Kulsoom ne mujhe teen ghont pilaein phir beemar ho gain aur mujhe teen ghont ke ilawa na pilaya, to main Aisha ke paas dakhil na ho saka is liye ke Umm Kulsoom ne mere liye das ghont poori na kin."
"1279","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Safiya bint Abi Ubaid ne unhein khabar di ke Hafsa Ummul Momineen ne Aasim bin Abdullah bin Saad ko apni behan Fatima bint Umar bin Khattab ke paas bheja taake use das ghont pilae taake wo un ke paas dakhil ho jabke wo chhota doodh peeta tha, to unhon ne aisa kya aur wo un ke paas dakhil hota tha."
"1280","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman bin Qasim se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha ke paas wo dakhil hote they jinhein un ki behnon aur bhatijiyon ne doodh pilaya ho, aur un ke paas wo dakhil na hote they jinhein un ke bhaiyon ki auraton ne doodh pilaya ho."
"1281","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibrahim bin Uqba se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se doodh ke bare mein pucha to Saeed ne kaha ke jo do saal mein ho chahe aik qatra ho wo haram karta hai, aur jo do saal ke baad ho wo sirf khana hai jo khata hai. Ibrahim bin Uqba ne kaha ke phir maine Urwa bin Zubair se pucha to unhon ne waisa hi kaha jaisa Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha tha."
"1282","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Saeed bin Musayyab ko kehte suna ke doodh sirf wo hai jo jhule mein ho, aur wo jo gosht aur khoon ugae."
"1283","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke wo kehte they ke doodh thoda aur zyada haram karta hai, aur mardon ki taraf se doodh haram karta hai. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke doodh thoda aur zyada jab do saal mein ho haram karta hai, aur jo do saal ke baad ho us ka thoda aur zyada kuchh haram nahi karta, wo sirf khane ke manzilay mein hai."
"1284","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke un se bade ke doodh ke bare mein pucha gaya to unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Urwa bin Zubair ne khabar di ke Abu Huzaifa bin Utba bin Rabia jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se they aur Badr mein hazir hue they, unhon ne Salim ko jo Salim Abu Huzaifa ke azad karda kahlata hai mutabanna banaya tha jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zaid bin Harisa ko mutabanna banaya tha, aur Abu Huzaifa ne Salim ka nikah kya jabke wo use apna beta samajhte they, us ka nikah apne bhai ki beti Fatima bint Waleed bin Utba bin Rabia se kya jo us waqt pehli hijrat karne waliyon mein se thin aur Quraish ki behtareen kunwariyon mein se thin, phir jab Allah Taala ne apni kitab mein Zaid bin Harisa ke bare mein jo nazil karna tha nazil kar diya aur kaha ke unhein un ke baapon ki taraf nisbat karke pukaro, ye Allah ke nazdeek zyada insaf hai, phir agar un ke baap na jano to deen mein tumhare bhai aur tumhare azad karda hain, to un mein se har aik ko us ke baap ki taraf lauta diya gaya, phir agar us ka baap malum na ho to us ke aaqa ki taraf lauta diya gaya, to Sahla bint Suhail jo Abu Huzaifa ki biwi hain jo Bani Aamir bin Luay mein se hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah hum Salim ko beta samajhte they aur wo mere paas dakhil hota tha jabke main khule chehre hoti aur hamare paas aik hi ghar hai, to Aap us ke mamle mein kya samajhte hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se kaha ke use paanch ghont pilao aur wo us ke doodh se haram ho jaye ga. Aur wo use doodh se beta samajhti thin, to Aisha Ummul Momineen ne us mardon mein se jinhein wo pasand karti thin ke un ke paas dakhil hon is ko liya, to wo apni behan Umm Kulsoom bint Abi Bakr Siddiq aur apni bhatijiyon ko hukm deti thin ke jinhein wo pasand karein ke un ke paas mardon mein se dakhil hon unhein doodh pilain, aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baqi biwiyon ne inkar kya ke un ke paas us doodh se logon mein se koi dakhil ho, aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam hum nahi samajhtein ke jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sahla bint Suhail ko hukm diya wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se sirf Salim ke doodh mein ruksat thi, Allah ki qasam hum par is doodh se koi dakhil na hoga, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwiyan bade ke doodh mein isi par thin."
"1285","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke aik shakhs Abdullah bin Umar ke paas aaya jabke main un ke sath Qaza ke ghar ke paas tha, un se bade ke doodh ke bare mein puchhta hua, to Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha ke aik shakhs Umar bin Khattab ke paas aaya aur kaha ke meri aik laundi thi aur main use pata tha, phir meri biwi ne us ka irada kya aur use doodh pila diya, phir main us ke paas dakhil hua to us ne kaha ke mere baghair, Allah ki qasam us ne use doodh pila diya hai. To Umar ne kaha ke use dard de aur apni laundi ke paas aa, kyunke doodh sirf chhote ka doodh hai."
"1286","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke aik shakhs ne Abu Musa Ashari se pucha aur kaha ke maine apni biwi ke than se doodh chusa aur wo mere pet mein chala gaya, to Abu Musa ne kaha ke main use nahi samajhta magar wo tum par haram ho gai hai. To Abdullah bin Masud ne kaha ke dekho tum shakhs ko kya fatwa dete ho. To Abu Musa ne kaha ke tum kya kehte ho. To Abdullah bin Masud ne kaha ke doodh sirf wo hai jo do saal mein ho. To Abu Musa ne kaha ke mujh se kisi cheez ke bare mein na puchho jab tak ye aalim tumhare darmiyan ho."
"1287","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Dinar se, unhon ne Sulaiman bin Yasar se, unhon ne Urwa bin Zubair se, unhon ne Aisha Ummul Momineen se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke doodh se wo haram hota hai jo wiladat se haram hota hai."
"1288","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Naufal se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe Urwa bin Zubair ne, unhon ne Aisha Ummul Momineen se, unhon ne Judama bint Wahb Asadiya se khabar di ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmate suna ke maine irada kya ke gheela se mana karun yahan tak ke yad aaya ke Room aur Faris aisa karte hain aur un ki aulad ko nuqsan nahi deta."
"1289","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abi Bakr bin Hazm se, unhon ne Amra bint Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Quran mein jo nazil hua us mein das maloom ghont they jo haram karte they, phir paanch maloom se mansookh hue, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut hue jabke wo Quran mein padha jata tha."
